ps://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cwly7vkke4jxo"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"my123"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Fujitsu launches made-in-Japan next-generation CPU FUJITSU-MONAKA"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://global.fujitsu/en-global/pr/news/2026/09/14-02"}},"_tags":["story","author_my123","story_49715813","front_page"],"author":"my123","children":[49740600,49740621,49740724,49740729],"created_at":"2026-09-15T17:28:38Z","created_at_i":1789493318,"num_comments":11,"objectID":"49715813","points":48,"story_id":49715813,"title":"Fujitsu launches made-in-Japan next-generation CPU FUJITSU-MONAKA","updated_at":"2026-09-17T13:58:30Z","url":"https://global.fujitsu/en-global/pr/news/2026/09/14-02"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"GloriaVinogrado"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Better Vector Search for Long Documents: Chunking Inside Manticore Search"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://manticoresearch.com/blog/auto-chunking/"}},"_tags":["story","author_GloriaVinogrado","story_49738766","front_page"],"author":"GloriaVinogrado","children":[49739660,49739719,49740204,49740537,49740582],"created_at":"2026-09-17T10:30:52Z","created_at_i":1789641052,"num_comments":7,"objectID":"49738766","points":40,"story_id":49738766,"title":"Better Vector Search for Long Documents: Chunking Inside Manticore Search","updated_at":"2026-09-17T13:57:31Z","url":"https://manticoresearch.com/blog/auto-chunking/"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"pawelwentpawel"},"story_text":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Hi HN!<p>flat.social is a fun spatial online meeting app for remote teams and communities. It's largely built like a web multiplayer game, and the 3D virtual spaces are highly customisable with elements and activities (I recently added surfing!).<p>Live demo to try it out: <a href=\"https://app.flat.social/f/demo-flat\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://app.flat.social/f/demo-flat</a><p>Here's a quick demo video: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GeinBNqL23s\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GeinBNqL23s</a><p>It's a solo, bootstrapped project built with Three.js, LiveKit and Rapier for physics. I built the first version during the pandemic and posted it here back then: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=31833415\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=31833415</a><p>I had a couple of months off this year, so I locked myself in an (almost) jungle house in Brazil and rebuilt it into what I've always wanted it to be.<p>Would love to hear what you think!"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Show HN: I built a new version of my fun spatial 3D online meeting app"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://flat.social"}},"_tags":["story","author_pawelwentpawel","story_49740047","show_hn","front_page"],"author":"pawelwentpawel","children":[49740273,49740358,49740367,49740389,49740467,49740545,49740557,49740571,49740735,49740746,49740756],"created_at":"2026-09-17T12:57:09Z","created_at_i":1789649829,"num_comments":16,"objectID":"49740047","points":32,"story_id":49740047,"story_text":"Hi HN!<p>flat.social is a fun spatial online meeting app for remote teams and communities. It&#x27;s largely built like a web multiplayer game, and the 3D virtual spaces are highly customisable with elements and activities (I recently added surfing!).<p>Live demo to try it out: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;app.flat.social&#x2F;f&#x2F;demo-flat\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;app.flat.social&#x2F;f&#x2F;demo-flat</a><p>Here&#x27;s a quick demo video: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.youtube.com&#x2F;watch?v=GeinBNqL23s\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.youtube.com&#x2F;watch?v=GeinBNqL23s</a><p>It&#x27;s a solo, bootstrapped project built with Three.js, LiveKit and Rapier for physics. I built the first version during the pandemic and posted it here back then: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;news.ycombinator.com&#x2F;item?id=31833415\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;news.ycombinator.com&#x2F;item?id=31833415</a><p>I had a couple of months off this year, so I locked myself in an (almost) jungle house in Brazil and rebuilt it into what I&#x27;ve always wanted it to be.<p>Would love to hear what you think!","title":"Show HN: I built a new version of my fun spatial 3D online meeting app","updated_at":"2026-09-17T13:58:30Z","url":"https://flat.social"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Bluestein"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Online Z3 Guide"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://microsoft.github.io/z3guide/"}},"_tags":["story","author_Bluestein","story_49713347","front_page"],"author":"Bluestein","children":[49738930,49740696],"created_at":"2026-09-15T14:45:08Z","created_at_i":1789483508,"num_comments":9,"objectID":"49713347","points":32,"story_id":49713347,"title":"Online Z3 Guide","updated_at":"2026-09-17T13:57:31Z","url":"https://microsoft.github.io/z3guide/"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"ashitlerferad"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"An Archive of Colour Gradients"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://phillips.shef.ac.uk/pub/cpt-city/"}},"_tags":["story","author_ashitlerferad","story_49694444","front_page"],"author":"ashitlerferad","children":[49698126,49702074],"created_at":"2026-09-14T10:08:35Z","created_at_i":1789380515,"num_comments":2,"objectID":"49694444","points":25,"story_id":49694444,"title":"An Archive of Colour Gradients","updated_at":"2026-09-17T13:52:02Z","url":"https://phillips.shef.ac.uk/pub/cpt-city/"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"pseudolus"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","